Package: node-sebastienrousseau-playwright-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 20)
Description: Shareable Playwright configuration rules for cross-browser E2E testing and parallel execution
 @sebastienrousseau/playwright-config is a shareable configuration preset with no runtime
 dependencies: inert data plus a loader.
 .
 Installed under /usr/share/nodejs so that require() resolves it without
 further configuration.
